Refused, as decided on 2026-10-11 (0011-MADR-harden-code-generator-engine.md,
phase 6 amendment, "Found in step 3 and decided"): a property whose allOf has
several schemas took the first $ref (F6).

-- meta.json --
{"version": 1, "agentMethods": {}, "clientMethods": {}, "protocolMethods": {"cancel_request": "$/cancel_request"}}
-- schema.json --
{"$defs": {
  "A": {"type": "object", "properties": {"a": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["a"]},
  "B": {"type": "object", "properties": {"b": {"type": "string"}}},
  "Holder": {"type": "object", "properties": {"ab": {"allOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/A"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/B"}]}}, "required": ["ab"]},
  "CancelRequestNotification": {"type": "object", "x-side": "protocol", "x-method": "$/cancel_request"}
}}
-- want.err --
Holder.properties.ab:
allOf of 2 schemas
